nald Trump plans to allow the purchase of Russian diesel, drawing criticism at home and abroad. What is behind the US president’s decision and what should Ukraine do next? DW spoke with experts.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Saudi Arabia's military struggle against Houthi attacks</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:c834218b2c80dee56f8604ad06cb834fbd378866b659e1c8f412ef40753ce457</id><updated>2026-10-14T05:04:26Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T16:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-s-military-struggle-against-houthi-attacks/a-79650857--d01d9c084eba.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/saudi-arabia-s-military-struggle-against-houthi-attacks/a-79650857?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Houthi attacks on airports and energy facilities are putting Saudi Arabia under pressure. Could a Saudi-led international military offensive succeed against the Iran-aligned Houthi militia in Yemen?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How will emergency rule in Pakistan's northwest affect Afghan ties?</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:52d55cb295aadd5f4d1b2a1b961cccc754262d1087096e522d253e4f6da266b7</id><updated>2026-10-14T05:04:26Z</updated><published>2026-10-13T16:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-will-emergency-rule-in-pakistan-s-northwest-affect-afghan-ties/a-79654262--94171911b4d1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-will-emergency-rule-in-pakistan-s-northwest-affect-afghan-ties/a-79654262?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Pakistan's decision to suspend Khyber Pakhtunkhwa's provincial government could further strain already tense relations between Islamabad and Kabul.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>DR Congo: Kabila’s move towards M23 raises questions over peace</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0432882d29f39916350cbba3bd58